  "instructions": [
    "heat the olive oil in a large ceramic tagine over medium heat.",
    "sauté the onion and garlic until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "add the mushrooms and cook until they release their liquid and start to brown, about 5 minutes.",
    "add the chicken broth, date syrup, cumin, coriander, cinnamon, and cayenne pepper to the tagine.",
    "stir to combine and bring to a boil.",
    "reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes, or until the flavors have melded together and the sauce has thickened.",
    "season with flaky sea salt to taste.",
    "garnish with parsley and dill before serving.",
    "serve immediately and enjoy!"
